msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Trakt插件也已启用。两个插件都会与Trakt进行自动记录和同步，因此所有操作都会执行两次。"

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "保留两者"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "开始重看"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "要在Trakt上开始重看吗？您的进度将从头开始，Kodi中的所有剧集都将标记为未观看。"

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "已开始重看"

msgctxt "#32223"
